ntions that his assistant Kerr is  eager to take his place however zeit  informs him that the company has decided  to keep turtle on Earth for the next 50  Cycles not only that he has to start  extracting the remaining gold from Earth  as soon as possible unsurprisingly  turtle is angry about the decision but  he can do nothing more than remains  silent on the other hand the captured  humans are locked inside a cell and are  treated like slaves they are then served  with gooey green food Floyd one of the  bullies inside the cell threatens  everyone that he and his gang will have  the food first and if anything Remains  the others can have it however Johnny  who is already sick of being controlled  by others decides to revolt soon a fight  breaks out between the two and Johnny  emerges Victorious he then declares that  everyone can have their food in equal  proportion and dismisses the idea of a  hierarchy meanwhile Turtle goes to meet  his assistant Kerr and finds him hiding  an important file curious he asks about  it and the latter replies that the file  contains pictures of a place from which  they can extract gold but they will not  be able to invade the place because  their breathing pipes won't work there  hearing this Turtle becomes angry and  accuses Kerr of trying to steal the gold  all by himself after punishing his  assistant he then devises a plan where  the human slaves will extract the gold  for them later he approaches their  senior officer planetship and proposes  the idea to him however the latter  immediately refuses claiming that it is  a violation of their company's rules the  next day when the humans are being  transported to their workplace Johnny  again tries to escape but just like the  last time he is caught as a punishment  the aliens removed Johnny's breathing  device and to leave him to die  fortunately one of the human slaves  notices him and saves his life meanwhile  turtle and kerr plan about training  humans and using them to extract 